The probability mass function for the Generalized Waring distribution is:
\deqn{
f(y \mid a_x, k, \rho) =
\frac{
  \Gamma(a_x + \rho)\Gamma(k + \rho)
  (a_x)_y(k)_y
}{
  y!\Gamma(\rho)\Gamma(a_x + k + \rho)
  (a_x + k + \rho)_y
}
